# Cloudflare response headers (PageSpeed → Best Practices → Trust and Safety)
# (Only one rule per path is applied, so every header for /* stays in this one block.)
# Stage is kept out of search by the Worker (worker/index.ts → serveAssets), not here.
# TODO: remove X-Robots-Tag at launch — keeps production out of search until the client approves the site (/prelaunch reminds)
/*
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex

# Hashed build assets never change under the same URL (Cloudflare's default is max-age=0)
/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
